      <title>金价飙升最大风险是技术突破击穿高成本矿山价值</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260902/%E9%87%91%E4%BB%B7%E9%A3%99%E5%8D%87%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E6%98%AF%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4%E5%87%BB%E7%A9%BF%E9%AB%98%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E7%9F%BF%E5%B1%B1%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC/</link>
